{"turn_id": "d21-t1", "session_id": "d21", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "num_tv_series", "text": "研究选择了三部电视剧：“花千骨”（The Journey of Flower）、“琅琊榜”（Nirvana in Fire）和“大好时光”（Good Time），作为影评数据集的一部分。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-4c54b2bdf952cba612027168"}]}, {"key": "series_labels", "text": "实验中“1”“2”“3”分别代表电视剧“花千骨”“琅琊榜”和“大好时光”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-a65bcd7ea05135dba44f5b2d"}]}, {"key": "per_series_samples", "text": "在符合标注筛选标准的每个电视剧中，各保留5000条评论作为数据。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.02378", "chunk_id": "c-83230732113c4324770750f5"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d21-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
